# workspace-housekeeping settings

Copy this file to `.claude/workspace-housekeeping.local.md` in your workspace root.

## Fields

| Field | Default | Purpose |
| ----- | ------- | ------- |
| `workspace_root` | Auto-detected from plugin install path | Absolute path to workspace root. Leave blank to auto-detect. Set explicitly if your plugin is not installed at `{workspace}/.claude/plugins/workspace-housekeeping/`. |
| `worklog_path` | `workshop/worklog.md` | Path to worklog file, relative to workspace root. |

## Auto-detection

When `workspace_root` is blank, hook scripts derive the workspace root by walking up from their own location:

```
{workspace}/.claude/plugins/workspace-housekeeping/hooks/scripts/
          ^--- 5 levels up = workspace root
```

This works correctly for standard plugin installation. Only set `workspace_root` explicitly if your directory layout differs.
